Update the current Feature 001 spec with this clarification:

DR workbooks are not guaranteed to have identical physical column layouts.
They share common business fields, but some DR workbooks may contain additional
columns or metrics that other DRs do not require.

The import behavior must:
- identify canonical fields by semantic header name rather than fixed column position;
- allow additional columns without shifting/corrupting known mappings;
- dynamically discover metric columns;
- normalize different DR workbook variants into the same canonical business model;
- not require DR-specific parsing behavior.

If an extra column represents genuinely different business semantics rather than
just a layout variation, surface it for clarification.

Do not create the technical plan yet. Update spec.md only.


